Platform audit fixes (#120, ADR-0013). Defects found by the full functional/UX audit of the built client:
- /register and /forgot-password showed their forms although both are off on this platform; the reset page then claimed
  an e-mail was sent. Both now return to the sign-in page when the server says the feature is off.
- An unknown address showed the technical error page (English text, "404 Not Found", a log download button); it now
  opens a new chat (or the sign-in page when signed out).
- The message editors were fixed left-to-right (the old `chatDirection` default): an Arabic message opened for editing
  ran from the left. They now follow the text (dir=auto), like the message box since 0002.
- In a chat with an agent the model button said «اختر نموذجًا» because the agents endpoint is not in the menu (model
  specs only); it now shows the agent's name.
- Dialogs: the close button's hidden label was the English word "Close", and in Arabic the title sat on the left with
  the close button on the right; the label is translated and both mirror in RTL.
- Dates in the archived chats and files tables were English month names ("Oct 2026 21" once mixed into RTL); Arabic
  pages now format them in Arabic with Western digits and the Gregorian calendar, English is unchanged.

